{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":7626,\"title\":\"The Monkees\",\"tagline\":\"Who's putting who on? You'll never know till you see this show!\",\"overview\":\"Micky, Mike, Peter, and Davy are four young men in mid-1960s LA, members of a struggling country-folk-rock band looking for their big break amid madcap encounters with a variety of people straight out of TV and movie central casting, with full knowledge that their existence is part of a weekly television series.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kNhWFmfVGkNfF3o3kdKUKgvdnaN.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8LkGGqYuoqq64jpZmpEtOoapTys.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":58,\"year\":1966,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":2,\"totalEpisodes\":58,\"createdBy\":[\"Bert Schneider\",\"Bob Rafelson\"],\"networks\":[\"NBC\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"1968-03-25\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":68457,\"name\":\"James Frawley\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qMG0tZVWuS2mkLbMSM97JrEJTTm.jpg\"},{\"id\":19450,\"name\":\"Bob Rafelson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tRTlLdcgGdV0R3EgrZig9zQw0Tk.jpg\"},{\"id\":39759,\"name\":\"Alexander Singer\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":100629,\"name\":\"Bruce Kessler\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gbM3XmXd842EHBdZpbfzvd8J2KO.jpg\"},{\"id\":152646,\"name\":\"Russ Mayberry\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2i7TpOigvtPO3AT5fOpO4ZTIe8D.jpg\"},{\"id\":168223,\"name\":\"Gerald Shepard\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1240851,\"name\":\"Jon C. Andersen\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":29700,\"name\":\"David Winters\",\"